{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0482165/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、ある撮影が地元埼玉であったので\n少しだけ実家に帰ることが出来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0482165/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々にお父さんやお母さんに会えて、\n思うことが 沢山ありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ小さい姪っ子がね、\nぐるぐるカーテン踊ってくれたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0482165/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0482165/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46が大好きらしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「さゆりちゃん」てのが 上手く言えなくて、\n「ちゃるりちゃん」に なっちゃうんだけど、\n一所懸命「ちゃるりちゃん頑張って！」って\n言ってくて、嬉しかった (*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな愛犬のリーくんにも会えた！\n犬のくせに猫みたいな奴！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0482165/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしりがモフモフで可愛い(*^p^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0482165/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜からはまた別のお仕事があって\nすぐに東京に戻らなきゃで、\n埼玉に長居は出来なかったけど\n素敵な時間を過ごすことが出来ました  ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空が高くてキレイだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0482165/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は天気が悪かったですが、\n皆さん風邪など引いてないですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は握手会、楽しみだよー＾＾"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0482165/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0482165/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0482165/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0482165/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sayunyanヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/23/0482165/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}